{"version":1,"content":"<p>《GTA6》於11月19日推出後，香港及華人玩家發現，遊戲車載電台收錄了林子祥的經典歌曲《敢愛敢做》。相關片段很快在社交平台引發討論，也讓劉德華與林子祥的一段往事再次受到關注。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/music/1587204.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T06:24:01.959691+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":93,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T05:55:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T06:17:18.820554+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T06:17:18.820554+00:00","content_hash":"01a28fe9b6a72bfc25bf6e425792f9d7b43213e6310d319217190a07035325fd","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}